Casting Blink grants you |cFFFFFFFFTime Distortion|r.

You will learn to create a |cFFFFFFFFTime Warp|r, allowing you to return to your original Blink position if cast within 3 seconds.

Your damaging spell casts with a cast time extend the duration of |cFFFFFFFFTime Distortion|r by 1 second and reduce the cooldown of Blink by 2 seconds.
